<div style="margin: 0px auto; max-width: 800px;">
  <table style="width: 100%;" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" align="center">
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td style="direction: ltr;
            font-size: 0px;
            padding: 50px 0;
            text-align: center;">
          <!--[if mso | IE]><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="" style="vertical-align:top;width:800px;" ><![endif]-->
          <div style="font-size: 0px;
              text-align: left;
              direction: ltr;
              display: inline-block;
              vertical-align: top;
              width: 100%;" class="mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix">
            <table width="100%" style="vertical-align: top;" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"
              border="0">
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td style="font-size: 0px;
                      padding: 10px 25px;
                      word-break: break-word;" align="left">
                    <div style="font-family: Source Sans Pro, Arial;
                        font-size: 13px;
                        line-height: 1.6;
                        text-align: left;
                        color: #154194;">
                      <h2 style="font-weight: 600;
                          margin: 0;
                          padding: 0;
                          font-size: 24px;
                          color: #154194;">
                        {{headline.de}}
                      </h2>
                    </div>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="font-size: 0px;
                      padding: 10px 25px;
                      padding-bottom: 32px;
                      word-break: break-word;" align="left">
                    <div style="font-family: Source Sans Pro, Arial;
                        font-size: 18px;
                        line-height: 1.6;
                        text-align: left;
                        color: #333333;">
                      Hallo {{profile.firstName}},<br><br>
                      wir freuen uns Dir mitteilen zu können, dass Du von der Warteliste nachgerückt bist und ab sofort als Teilnehmer:in beim Event <b><a href="{{event.url}}">{{event.name}}</a></b> gelistet wirst. Wir wünschen Dir eine spannende und inspirierende Veranstaltung.<br><br>
                      Termin: {{event.date.de}}<br>
                      {{#if event.location}}
                      Ort: {{event.location}}<br>
                      {{/if}}
                      {{#if event.conferenceLink}}
                      Konferenz-Link: <a href="{{event.conferenceLink}}">{{event.conferenceLink}}</a><br>
                      {{/if}}
                      <br>
                      {{#if profile.isGuest}}
                        {{#if event.revocationLink}}
                      Wenn sich bei Dir etwas ändert und Du doch nicht teilnehmen kannst, dann ziehe bitte Deine Teilnahme über den <a href="{{event.revocationLink}}">Abmeldelink</a> zurück, so dass andere nachrücken können.<br><br>
                        {{/if}}
                      {{else}}
                      Wenn sich bei Dir etwas ändert und Du doch nicht teilnehmen kannst, dann ziehe bitte auf der Community-Plattform Deine Teilnahme zurück, so dass andere nachrücken können.<br><br>
                      {{/if}}
                      Wenn Du Fragen dazu hast, melde Dich gern beim Event-Team.<br><br>
                      Viele Grüße<br>Dein MINTvernetzt-Team
                    </div>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<table
    style="background: #e6e8ec; background-color: #e6e8ec; width: 100%"
    role="presentation"
    cellspacing="0"
    cellpadding="0"
    border="0"
    align="center"
  >
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>
          <!--[if mso | IE]><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="" role="presentation" style="width:800px;" width="600" bgcolor="#E6E8EC" ><tr><td style="line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;"><![endif]-->
          <div style="margin: 0px auto; max-width: 800px">
            <table
              style="width: 100%"
              role="presentation"
              cellspacing="0"
              cellpadding="0"
              border="0"
              align="center"
            >
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td
                    style="
                      direction: ltr;
                      font-size: 0px;
                      padding: 1px 0;
                      text-align: center;
                    "
                  >
                    <!--[if mso | IE
                      ]><table
                        role="presentation"
                        border="0"
                        cellpadding="0"
                        cellspacing="0"
                      ></table
                    ><![endif]-->
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="margin: 0px auto; max-width: 800px;">
  <table style="width: 100%;" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" align="center">
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td style="direction: ltr;
            font-size: 0px;
            padding: 50px 0;
            text-align: center;">
          <!--[if mso | IE]><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="" style="vertical-align:top;width:800px;" ><![endif]-->
          <div style="font-size: 0px;
              text-align: left;
              direction: ltr;
              display: inline-block;
              vertical-align: top;
              width: 100%;" class="mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix">
            <table width="100%" style="vertical-align: top;" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"
              border="0">
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td style="font-size: 0px;
                      padding: 10px 25px;
                      word-break: break-word;" align="left">
                    <div style="font-family: Source Sans Pro, Arial;
                        font-size: 13px;
                        line-height: 1.6;
                        text-align: left;
                        color: #154194;">
                      <h2 style="font-weight: 600;
                          margin: 0;
                          padding: 0;
                          font-size: 24px;
                          color: #154194;">
                        {{headline.en}}
                      </h2>
                    </div>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="font-size: 0px;
                      padding: 10px 25px;
                      padding-bottom: 32px;
                      word-break: break-word;" align="left">
                    <div style="font-family: Source Sans Pro, Arial;
                        font-size: 18px;
                        line-height: 1.6;
                        text-align: left;
                        color: #333333;">
                      Hello {{profile.firstName}},<br><br>
                      we are pleased to inform you that you have moved up from the waiting list and are now listed as a participant for the event <b><a href="{{event.url}}">{{event.name}}</a></b>. We wish you an exciting and inspiring event.<br><br>
                      Date: {{event.date.en}}<br>
                      {{#if event.location}}
                      Location: {{event.location}}<br>
                      {{/if}}
                      {{#if event.conferenceLink}}
                      Conference link: <a href="{{event.conferenceLink}}">{{event.conferenceLink}}</a><br>
                      {{/if}}
                      <br>
                      {{#if profile.isGuest}}
                        {{#if event.revocationLink}}
                      If your plans change and you are unable to attend, please withdraw your participation using the <a href="{{event.revocationLink}}">revocation link</a> so that others can move up.<br><br>
                        {{/if}}
                      {{else}}
                      If your plans change and you are unable to attend, please withdraw your participation on the community platform so that others can move up.<br><br>
                      {{/if}}
                      If you have any questions, feel free to contact the event team.<br><br>
                      Best regards<br>The MINTvernetzt Team
                    </div>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>